1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,960
Yes, hello sir.

2
00:00:01,960 --> 00:00:03,128
But may I ask you why...

3
00:00:03,420 --> 00:00:04,352
I called to talk about

4
00:00:04,353 --> 00:00:05,212
the recital.

5
00:00:05,213 --> 00:00:07,257
Personally, I was shocked.

6
00:00:08,925 --> 00:00:09,759
I'm sorry sir.

7
00:00:09,759 --> 00:00:10,922
I was very impressed at how

8
00:00:10,923 --> 00:00:12,136
you calmly covered for him

9
00:00:12,137 --> 00:00:14,514
and even led him

10
00:00:14,514 --> 00:00:15,944
through the rest of the song

11
00:00:15,945 --> 00:00:17,725
after Seonghun made a mistake.

12
00:00:17,726 --> 00:00:19,764
You both have
incredible talent

13
00:00:19,765 --> 00:00:21,924
just as I've heard.

14
00:00:22,272 --> 00:00:23,314
Thank you, sir.

15
00:00:23,648 --> 00:00:25,608
What's your next plan?

16
00:00:25,942 --> 00:00:27,027
Ah, silly question.

17
00:00:27,569 --> 00:00:29,696
You must be preparing

18
00:00:29,696 --> 00:00:30,564
for the upcoming

19
00:00:30,565 --> 00:00:31,565
competition.

20
00:00:31,906 --> 00:00:33,616
Actually, sir...

21
00:00:33,616 --> 00:00:35,285
I'm sorry to interrupt

22
00:00:35,744 --> 00:00:37,419
but I won't be able to attend.

23
00:00:37,912 --> 00:00:40,206
What do you mean?

24
00:00:40,749 --> 00:00:42,000
My circumstances aren't great.

25
00:00:43,334 --> 00:00:45,503
Since I lost the scholarship

26
00:00:45,879 --> 00:00:46,816
I don't think it's possible

27
00:00:46,817 --> 00:00:47,921
right now.

28
00:00:47,922 --> 00:00:50,133
What are you talking about?

29
00:00:50,425 --> 00:00:51,748
Hasn't Professor Tae-seong

30
00:00:51,749 --> 00:00:53,185
informed you?

31
00:00:53,970 --> 00:00:55,388
You're this term's

32
00:00:55,388 --> 00:00:57,098
scholarship student, Dong-uk.

33
00:00:57,098 --> 00:00:58,058
Excuse me?

34
00:00:58,058 --> 00:00:59,403
I've seen countless

35
00:00:59,404 --> 00:01:00,726
performances over the years

36
00:01:00,727 --> 00:01:02,036
but I've never seen a pianist

37
00:01:02,037 --> 00:01:03,604
look so happy while playing.

38
00:01:03,605 --> 00:01:05,139
With that energy, I'm sure

39
00:01:05,140 --> 00:01:06,806
you'll do well, even abroad.

40
00:01:08,068 --> 00:01:09,277
Thank you so much, sir.

41
00:01:09,277 --> 00:01:10,414
Alright.

42
00:01:10,415 --> 00:01:11,612
I'll be in touch soon.

43
00:01:11,613 --> 00:01:13,198
Great job, Dong-uk.

44
00:01:24,584 --> 00:01:25,668
Thank you.

45
00:01:27,837 --> 00:01:29,798
Your hands are soft too.

46
00:01:30,590 --> 00:01:31,263
That's why you're

47
00:01:31,264 --> 00:01:32,267
such a great pianist.
